<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
  One colour version for places the system tints the icon itself: the ongoing
  notification, the quick settings tile, and the themed launcher icon. The two
  coloured units are dropped because a tint would flatten them into the shield;
  the channel survives as a hole and carries the shape on its own.
  The channel runs past the shield's right edge on purpose. Even-odd fill
  counts that overhang as inside one subpath, which would paint it solid, so
  a third subpath covers exactly the overhang and makes the count even again.
-->
